      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"In the name of Natural Law, the enduring principles of the High Seas, and the inherent rights of discovery, we, the undersigned, hereby proclaim this Declaration. Recognizing the vacuum of effective jurisdiction within these unceded waters, we assert that the very act of discovery grants an unassailable moral and legal foundation to this claim. By the sovereign prerogative vested in the pioneering spirit, we establish ourselves as the sole, legitimate, and supreme governing authority over this domain.\"",
      "source": "target",
